(6897419, 1039092, 91496, '<td valign="top">Love the B&amp;W tones and the lovely lines in the image.  It was a brave choice to have the sky so narrow, but I think it works great.</td>', 'Love the B&W tones and the lovely lines in the image.  It was a brave choice to have the sky so narrow, but I think it works great.', '2012-11-03 21:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897420, 1039300, 91496, '<td valign="top">Love the mood here witht he mist.  The reddish rocks are uncommon in this type of scene and I really like the effect.</td>', 'Love the mood here witht he mist.  The reddish rocks are uncommon in this type of scene and I really like the effect.', '2012-11-03 21:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897421, 1039840, 91496, '<td valign="top">Is the water moving away from you.  It adds some interest as we want to see where it goes.  Great leading line into the "V" of the mountains.</td>', 'Is the water moving away from you.  It adds some interest as we want to see where it goes.  Great leading line into the "V" of the mountains.', '2012-11-03 21:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897423, 1038643, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nicely caught in what looks like a tough lighting situation.  The angle and placement of the planes is really what makes this shot work.</td>', 'Nicely caught in what looks like a tough lighting situation.  The angle and placement of the planes is really what makes this shot work.', '2012-11-03 21:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897424, 1038654, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the repitition between the trees, the figures, and the reflections.  The gap between the right two people really spaces them nicely.</td>', 'I like the repitition between the trees, the figures, and the reflections.  The gap between the right two people really spaces them nicely.', '2012-11-03 21:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897428, 1037104, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the textures of the barn and the silo.  I think there are too many objects in the scene and they take you are away from the subject too much.</td>', 'I like the textures of the barn and the silo.  I think there are too many objects in the scene and they take you are away from the subject too much.', '2012-11-03 21:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897430, 1039834, 91496, '<td valign="top">Not sure this scene has enough interesting features to really catch my interest.  Perhaps a lower and closer viewpoint on the pathway would be somehting to try.</td>', 'Not sure this scene has enough interesting features to really catch my interest.  Perhaps a lower and closer viewpoint on the pathway would be somehting to try.', '2012-11-03 21:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897435, 1039377, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the technique here with the lighting and motion blur.  I am not sure the black negative space on the left really adds to the image.</td>', 'I like the technique here with the lighting and motion blur.  I am not sure the black negative space on the left really adds to the image.', '2012-11-03 21:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897439, 1039562, 91496, '<td valign="top">Interesting fog to try to set the mood.  The large expanse of water and sky is not that interesting and there is no real subject present to capture my attention.</td>', 'Interesting fog to try to set the mood.  The large expanse of water and sky is not that interesting and there is no real subject present to capture my attention.', '2012-11-03 21:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897444, 1038623, 91496, '<td valign="top">While he/she is cute, the pacifer is blocking the smile, which I would love to see.  Not sure the figure adds much at this angle.  Perhaps if you got them to be on the other side they might add more story elements to the image.</td>', 'While he/she is cute, the pacifer is blocking the smile, which I would love to see.  Not sure the figure adds much at this angle.  Perhaps if you got them to be on the other side they might add more story elements to the image.', '2012-11-03 21:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897450, 1039559, 91496, '<td valign="top">Interesting grouping of people all doing differnet things. They are very small however and the somewhat boring sky really dominates the image.  Perhaps you could have used a paneled crop here to good effect.  Also, watch your horizon, as this one has a slight tilt.</td>', 'Interesting grouping of people all doing differnet things. They are very small however and the somewhat boring sky really dominates the image.  Perhaps you could have used a paneled crop here to good effect.  Also, watch your horizon, as this one has a slight tilt.', '2012-11-03 21:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897452, 1037366, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice fall colors.  Buildings can be hard to shoot.  Look for intersting angles and viewpoints to create interest.  Do not be afraid to move in closer and crop out parts of the building as showing the entire structure can often be a static scene.</td>', 'Nice fall colors.  Buildings can be hard to shoot.  Look for intersting angles and viewpoints to create interest.  Do not be afraid to move in closer and crop out parts of the building as showing the entire structure can often be a static scene.', '2012-11-03 22:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897453, 1039512, 91496, '<td valign="top">Interesting moment that has some humor value.  That said the scene is kind of busy with too many objects and greenery competiting to be seen.  The bride is the focal point but her back is turned and that really weakens it.</td>', 'Interesting moment that has some humor value.  That said the scene is kind of busy with too many objects and greenery competiting to be seen.  The bride is the focal point but her back is turned and that really weakens it.', '2012-11-03 22:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897457, 1035904, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like a good abstract as much as anyone, but I still need a subject or focal point to look at and appeciate.  The grey forms here blend into the grey background and did not grab my interest at all.</td>', 'I like a good abstract as much as anyone, but I still need a subject or focal point to look at and appeciate.  The grey forms here blend into the grey background and did not grab my interest at all.', '2012-11-03 22:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897458, 1038852, 91496, '<td valign="top">Wow, those colors sure grab you and scream "look at me".  I think it is overdone and loses a lot appeal as a result.</td>', 'Wow, those colors sure grab you and scream "look at me".  I think it is overdone and loses a lot appeal as a result.', '2012-11-03 22:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
