(6897599, 1039399, 59737, '<td valign="top">nice setting looks like a great place to visit, the waterfall which is the point of interest for me is very small in the image with the rock walls on the right not adding much to the picture.</td>', 'nice setting looks like a great place to visit, the waterfall which is the point of interest for me is very small in the image with the rock walls on the right not adding much to the picture.', '2012-11-04 08:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897602, 1038983, 59737, '<td valign="top">nice combination of earth, water and sky, the beams of light coming out above the clouds are nice, bet this looks fantastic at larger size.  Good colors and composition.</td>', 'nice combination of earth, water and sky, the beams of light coming out above the clouds are nice, bet this looks fantastic at larger size.  Good colors and composition.', '2012-11-04 08:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897603, 1038057, 59737, '<td valign="top">Nice, gritty and dirty photo, the title is funny to me as it doesn''t match the scene, really like the repeating bands of light going down the passage.  Strong composition.  This would look good in B+W but glad you left it in color.</td>', 'Nice, gritty and dirty photo, the title is funny to me as it doesn''t match the scene, really like the repeating bands of light going down the passage.  Strong composition.  This would look good in B+W but glad you left it in color.', '2012-11-04 08:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897604, 1037247, 59737, '<td valign="top">This image looks like is was taken near the middle of the day, the colors look like they could be fantastic but they''re kind of flat due to the time of day the shot was taken.</td>', 'This image looks like is was taken near the middle of the day, the colors look like they could be fantastic but they''re kind of flat due to the time of day the shot was taken.', '2012-11-04 08:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897606, 1039506, 59737, '<td valign="top">very nice wedding shot, the couple should be happy with this one, the flare really makes this moment all the more magical.  Kepping the details in the shadowed braids is very nice.</td>', 'very nice wedding shot, the couple should be happy with this one, the flare really makes this moment all the more magical.  Kepping the details in the shadowed braids is very nice.', '2012-11-04 08:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897607, 1039098, 59737, '<td valign="top">great colors and light, the veil like nature of the wave is well captured here, the color transitions really capture my attention and the detail at the end of the barrel is nice and gives a focal point you get drawn into</td>', 'great colors and light, the veil like nature of the wave is well captured here, the color transitions really capture my attention and the detail at the end of the barrel is nice and gives a focal point you get drawn into', '2012-11-04 09:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897608, 1039782, 59737, '<td valign="top">Potentially funny, and dangerous moment captured here, overall the image doesn''t do much for me as there''s a lot in the image that doesn''t add to the impact.  The sky is a flat color and there''s a lot of foreground rock that doesn''t help draw me into the picture.</td>', 'Potentially funny, and dangerous moment captured here, overall the image doesn''t do much for me as there''s a lot in the image that doesn''t add to the impact.  The sky is a flat color and there''s a lot of foreground rock that doesn''t help draw me into the picture.', '2012-11-04 09:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897612, 1039541, 59737, '<td valign="top">nice capture, the highlights on the line are great and are a very nice detail to have captured, great lighting and feel to this.</td>', 'nice capture, the highlights on the line are great and are a very nice detail to have captured, great lighting and feel to this.', '2012-11-04 09:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897621, 1039759, 59737, '<td valign="top">cool looking fireplace, the ashes and cinders springing from the fire are a nice touch and add a visual impact, it''s a little thing but it''s nice and level to my eye which shows good attention to detail.  I think the slight off center of the flame which looks like it was done to capture all of the pan was a good decision on your part.</td>', 'cool looking fireplace, the ashes and cinders springing from the fire are a nice touch and add a visual impact, it''s a little thing but it''s nice and level to my eye which shows good attention to detail.  I think the slight off center of the flame which looks like it was done to capture all of the pan was a good decision on your part.', '2012-11-04 09:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897625, 1039487, 59737, '<td valign="top">cool bottle, would look really cool with a drip candle in it with wax running down over the skull, as it is now it doesn''t have the visual impact and pow that I''m looking for.</td>', 'cool bottle, would look really cool with a drip candle in it with wax running down over the skull, as it is now it doesn''t have the visual impact and pow that I''m looking for.', '2012-11-04 09:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897628, 1039453, 59737, '<td valign="top">nice street scene, the HDR/tonemapped processing on this doesn''t work for me but maybe helps to capture the feel you had in being there.</td>', 'nice street scene, the HDR/tonemapped processing on this doesn''t work for me but maybe helps to capture the feel you had in being there.', '2012-11-04 09:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897634, 1039883, 59737, '<td valign="top">not a bad city scene, could be a city almost anywhere western, seems kind of soft probably from the re-sizing, like the starburst effect, the flat sky with the clouds doesn''t help you much with this photo</td>', 'not a bad city scene, could be a city almost anywhere western, seems kind of soft probably from the re-sizing, like the starburst effect, the flat sky with the clouds doesn''t help you much with this photo', '2012-11-04 09:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897635, 1038654, 59737, '<td valign="top">nice high key, great processing on this to get the effect, like that they''re not all looking at you, know of them are actually, makes it feel a little more natural, background is also nice with just enough detail but not a distraction.</td>', 'nice high key, great processing on this to get the effect, like that they''re not all looking at you, know of them are actually, makes it feel a little more natural, background is also nice with just enough detail but not a distraction.', '2012-11-04 09:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
