(6900802, 1039850, 12253, '<td valign="top">Commenting only: Very good mood in this shot.  The rays make the shot but could be more defined.  Small crits: the border overpowers this (and I generally like borders.  A bit odd in the toning...some sepia, some platinum/bw.</td>', 'Commenting only: Very good mood in this shot.  The rays make the shot but could be more defined.  Small crits: the border overpowers this (and I generally like borders.  A bit odd in the toning...some sepia, some platinum/bw.', '2012-11-07 12:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
