(6900805, 1039873, 12253, '<td valign="top">Commenting only: Very good shot, I like the foreground for depth and a bit of leading lines.  Good clarity.  Detailed crit: Lacks a focal point (not always necessary, but would help here) ... the leading lines lead me in, but I end up in the water.  A boat in there would have been perfect.  Lighting could be more interesting...mostly flat except for the sun on the peaks.</td>', 'Commenting only: Very good shot, I like the foreground for depth and a bit of leading lines.  Good clarity.  Detailed crit: Lacks a focal point (not always necessary, but would help here) ... the leading lines lead me in, but I end up in the water.  A boat in there would have been perfect.  Lighting could be more interesting...mostly flat except for the sun on the peaks.', '2012-11-07 13:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6900806, 1038668, 64446, '<td valign="top">Amazing burst of colors and contrast between the dark blue and fiery yellow/orange! Nicely done!!</td>', 'Amazing burst of colors and contrast between the dark blue and fiery yellow/orange! Nicely done!!', '2012-11-07 13:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6900807, 1037869, 12253, '<td valign="top">Commenting only: Beautiful colors.  Detailed crit: composition is uninteresting and not dynamic.</td>', 'Commenting only: Beautiful colors.  Detailed crit: composition is uninteresting and not dynamic.', '2012-11-07 13:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6900809, 1039785, 64446, '<td valign="top">Perfect! Thank you for sharing such a beauty...</td>', 'Perfect! Thank you for sharing such a beauty...', '2012-11-07 13:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6900811, 1038985, 12253, '<td valign="top">Commenting only: I like the composition of this, and the intense pose/stare.  My detailed crit is the highlights seem a bit close to overexposzed.  Might have been interesting to darken it a bit more, and if you wanted the left right contrast, let the right side of the pic get a bit darker as opposed to normal.</td>', 'Commenting only: I like the composition of this, and the intense pose/stare.  My detailed crit is the highlights seem a bit close to overexposzed.  Might have been interesting to darken it a bit more, and if you wanted the left right contrast, let the right side of the pic get a bit darker as opposed to normal.', '2012-11-07 13:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6900812, 1039092, 12253, '<td valign="top">Commenting only: Excellent overall.  Nitpicky crits: foreground could be a little crisper.  Also, this may be just an illusion of the intense pattern, but I can almost see colors in the pattern...either an illusion or moire?</td>', 'Commenting only: Excellent overall.  Nitpicky crits: foreground could be a little crisper.  Also, this may be just an illusion of the intense pattern, but I can almost see colors in the pattern...either an illusion or moire?', '2012-11-07 13:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6900813, 1038826, 12253, '<td valign="top">Commenting only: Great moon shot.  Curious about the large softer area in between two sharper areas...I assume that''s atmospheric.</td>', 'Commenting only: Great moon shot.  Curious about the large softer area in between two sharper areas...I assume that''s atmospheric.', '2012-11-07 13:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6900814, 1039608, 12253, '<td valign="top">Commenting only: Well done.</td>', 'Commenting only: Well done.', '2012-11-07 13:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6900816, 1039821, 64446, '<td valign="top">Great details and textures...</td>', 'Great details and textures...', '2012-11-07 13:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6900818, 1039210, 12253, '<td valign="top">Commenting only: Great scene, love the bg...I think it would be more interesting though if the foreground had more detail rather than being in sillouette.  In that way, the two "layers" are used for depth, and there''s still a wonderful focal point in the foreground, a la David Muench.</td>', 'Commenting only: Great scene, love the bg...I think it would be more interesting though if the foreground had more detail rather than being in sillouette.  In that way, the two "layers" are used for depth, and there''s still a wonderful focal point in the foreground, a la David Muench.', '2012-11-07 13:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6900820, 1039850, 38162, '<td valign="top">heavy border doesnt help here.  gl</td>', 'heavy border doesnt help here.  gl', '2012-11-07 13:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6900821, 1039102, 12253, '<td valign="top">Commenting only: This is beautifully captured, and has a lovely ethereal quality to it.  However, to me the shipwreck isn''t much to look at...doesn''t look anything like a ship, which usually works very well.  Just looks like flotsam and thus in my opinion actually detracts from the scene.</td>', 'Commenting only: This is beautifully captured, and has a lovely ethereal quality to it.  However, to me the shipwreck isn''t much to look at...doesn''t look anything like a ship, which usually works very well.  Just looks like flotsam and thus in my opinion actually detracts from the scene.', '2012-11-07 13:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6900823, 1039833, 12253, '<td valign="top">Commenting only: I like the scene, nicely captured.  Seems like the left is clipped to quickly...road is too close to the edge, and the tree at the top has too little to be included (so framing a bit more to the left would have included more while moving the road off the edge).</td>', 'Commenting only: I like the scene, nicely captured.  Seems like the left is clipped to quickly...road is too close to the edge, and the tree at the top has too little to be included (so framing a bit more to the left would have included more while moving the road off the edge).', '2012-11-07 13:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6900824, 1038715, 12253, '<td valign="top">Commenting only: Very well captured, and of course natural (assuming the cat wasn''t just playing with it but intends to eat it) but hard to look at.</td>', 'Commenting only: Very well captured, and of course natural (assuming the cat wasn''t just playing with it but intends to eat it) but hard to look at.', '2012-11-07 13:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6900826, 1039536, 12253, '<td valign="top">Commenting only:  Great capture.  Nits: Seems a bit oversharpened, with artifacts, and maybe too much contrast in spots.    I think a general softening/glow would have worked here well, excluding the water in the center perhaps to leave it sharp.</td>', 'Commenting only:  Great capture.  Nits: Seems a bit oversharpened, with artifacts, and maybe too much contrast in spots.    I think a general softening/glow would have worked here well, excluding the water in the center perhaps to leave it sharp.', '2012-11-07 13:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
