(6900867, 1038826, 108580, '<td valign="top">Quality moon shot. What makes it stand out is not just the PP but this time it is not the entire moon that''s visible but "cropped" into the frame. DOF seems extremely shallow so either you were on the ISS, you have a 2000mm f/4 on APS-C (3000/3200mm equivalent) or you did some creative blurring on an entirely in focus moon :) 9.</td>', 'Quality moon shot. What makes it stand out is not just the PP but this time it is not the entire moon that''s visible but "cropped" into the frame. DOF seems extremely shallow so either you were on the ISS, you have a 2000mm f/4 on APS-C (3000/3200mm equivalent) or you did some creative blurring on an entirely in focus moon :) 9.', '2012-11-07 13:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
