(6901031, 1036738, 143622, '<td valign="top">Very pretty with the nice bokeh but in order to pull these off, the focus realy needs to be super sharp. tripod, mirror lock,  focus in iive view, and a good lens gets you there.</td>', 'Very pretty with the nice bokeh but in order to pull these off, the focus realy needs to be super sharp. tripod, mirror lock,  focus in iive view, and a good lens gets you there.', '2012-11-07 16:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6901040, 1039833, 76335, '<td valign="top">Quiet, nice muted tones. Espeically like the pitiful branchless tree, frame left.</td>', 'Quiet, nice muted tones. Espeically like the pitiful branchless tree, frame left.', '2012-11-07 16:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6901041, 1039858, 143622, '<td valign="top">This turned out great. Wonderful focus and great outfit popping the face and losing much of else. I may be completely off base here but I''m wondering if you put a level of gaussian or similar blur or did a combined action to smooth out his face?  If not and it''s just crazy baby smooth complexion--that''s fine. If not, my feeling is that you went to far in smoothing the face; to me it just isn''t needed. I nothing done and just his face, my apologies. Perfect for the B and W onversion and nicely framed.</td>', 'This turned out great. Wonderful focus and great outfit popping the face and losing much of else. I may be completely off base here but I''m wondering if you put a level of gaussian or similar blur or did a combined action to smooth out his face?  If not and it''s just crazy baby smooth complexion--that''s fine. If not, my feeling is that you went to far in smoothing the face; to me it just isn''t needed. I nothing done and just his face, my apologies. Perfect for the B and W onversion and nicely framed.', '2012-11-07 16:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6901045, 1039776, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the mix of high-key and low-key. Great charcoal textures and tones.</td>', 'I like the mix of high-key and low-key. Great charcoal textures and tones.', '2012-11-07 16:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
