(6901058, 1036828, 143622, '<td valign="top">Nicely focused, good colors, and crisp. That verical line I find distracting. It also seems to have a bit too much room on the left side of the frame??? The feels a little centered and there seems as I said, to be a bit more space to left tnan optimum. I like the negative space this guy presents, but wonder if it could be taken more advantage of.</td>', 'Nicely focused, good colors, and crisp. That verical line I find distracting. It also seems to have a bit too much room on the left side of the frame??? The feels a little centered and there seems as I said, to be a bit more space to left tnan optimum. I like the negative space this guy presents, but wonder if it could be taken more advantage of.', '2012-11-07 16:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6901062, 1039298, 76335, '<td valign="top">How irrelevant we are!</td>', 'How irrelevant we are!', '2012-11-07 16:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6901063, 1039821, 143622, '<td valign="top">sharp, good colors, and great backgorund. Might clone out the white thing at the top as it may catch an eye or two. I like the square crop, but wonder what it would look like bring the right side in a bit more and the bottom up, as I really like the negative space you get at the left and top but that falls off a bit on the right. <br/> <br/>just a few cents there, but nice.</td>', 'sharp, good colors, and great backgorund. Might clone out the white thing at the top as it may catch an eye or two. I like the square crop, but wonder what it would look like bring the right side in a bit more and the bottom up, as I really like the negative space you get at the left and top but that falls off a bit on the right.  just a few cents there, but nice.', '2012-11-07 16:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6901069, 1037973, 143622, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous scene, nice compostion, good DOF, and nice colors. I''m sure you know the one nit pick on this one and I know it only too well. The Peak--framed too close at top and nipped below. Like the pops of the aspen leaves amidst the snow and yellow brush and how you brought them out.</td>', 'Gorgeous scene, nice compostion, good DOF, and nice colors. I''m sure you know the one nit pick on this one and I know it only too well. The Peak--framed too close at top and nipped below. Like the pops of the aspen leaves amidst the snow and yellow brush and how you brought them out.', '2012-11-07 16:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6901070, 1039509, 143622, '<td valign="top">I like this and the setup and her looking ouside the scene and the B and W. I think it would be stronger, with more focus on the central subject with shallow DOF. As it is, there are 2 scenes going on.</td>', 'I like this and the setup and her looking ouside the scene and the B and W. I think it would be stronger, with more focus on the central subject with shallow DOF. As it is, there are 2 scenes going on.', '2012-11-07 16:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6901076, 1039538, 143622, '<td valign="top">Great scene and beautiful colors and lines. Love the light on the fields, the range of those burnt to green colors and the line from shadow to sun in the bottom part of the frame. <br/> <br/>Perahps stronger would be at a vantage point to the right given the fence lines more diagonal lines. The sky does nothing for the image and if anything may to my eye detract some. I wonder if cropping this a bit more would help. Nice.</td>', 'Great scene and beautiful colors and lines. Love the light on the fields, the range of those burnt to green colors and the line from shadow to sun in the bottom part of the frame.  Perahps stronger would be at a vantage point to the right given the fence lines more diagonal lines. The sky does nothing for the image and if anything may to my eye detract some. I wonder if cropping this a bit more would help. Nice.', '2012-11-07 16:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6901079, 1039851, 143622, '<td valign="top">I alwasy like seeing eagles. To my eye, this fellow could use a bit of brigheting up a speck of contrast.</td>', 'I alwasy like seeing eagles. To my eye, this fellow could use a bit of brigheting up a speck of contrast.', '2012-11-07 16:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
