(6901595, 1037973, 45826, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have had more area above the peak and the reflection also. I tried several different perspectives. It''s the best I could get. I used an 18 - 200 lens at 18 mm. Wish I would have had a 14 - 24mm lens. Would have made it just a little better. 10th place is still good. Thanks for the votes and comments.</td>', 'I would have liked to have had more area above the peak and the reflection also. I tried several different perspectives. It''s the best I could get. I used an 18 - 200 lens at 18 mm. Wish I would have had a 14 - 24mm lens. Would have made it just a little better. 10th place is still good. Thanks for the votes and comments.', '2012-11-08 00:09:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6901596, 1039758, 114285, '<td valign="top">26th you can''t complain about that hey!</td>', '26th you can''t complain about that hey!', '2012-11-08 00:09:13.000000', NULL, 0),
