(6901731, 1038652, 28742, '<td valign="top">Technically a decent photo, but artistically "meh". It looks like a documentary type photo - a newspaper or catalog type shot. Not sure about the high number of 2 votes - that does seem odd, but sometimes there''s no explaining voting patterns. Just can''t dwell on it. Free Studies are very tough competitions and pulling a 5 for your first try is not bad at all. When I (rarely) enter a FS, I usually ask myself "is this something I or someone else would hang on their wall?". More emphasis on artistic qualities and WOW factor. Hope that helps.</td>', 'Technically a decent photo, but artistically "meh". It looks like a documentary type photo - a newspaper or catalog type shot. Not sure about the high number of 2 votes - that does seem odd, but sometimes there''s no explaining voting patterns. Just can''t dwell on it. Free Studies are very tough competitions and pulling a 5 for your first try is not bad at all. When I (rarely) enter a FS, I usually ask myself "is this something I or someone else would hang on their wall?". More emphasis on artistic qualities and WOW factor. Hope that helps.', '2012-11-08 02:45:14.000000', NULL, 0),
