(6901858, 1038652, 54446, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 7 on this image.  I love the natural look.  Colors seem natural and pleasant to me.  The blurred background is good, but the oof apples hanging around distract slightly.  I might have darkened the outside portions a bit.  Square formats are not eye-pleasing.  Has to be the right subject to go for centered and symmetrical.  Your subject is not symmetrical.  Overall, this is an okay photo.  Can''t explain the 2s.  Not very nice voters these days.</td>', 'I gave you a 7 on this image.  I love the natural look.  Colors seem natural and pleasant to me.  The blurred background is good, but the oof apples hanging around distract slightly.  I might have darkened the outside portions a bit.  Square formats are not eye-pleasing.  Has to be the right subject to go for centered and symmetrical.  Your subject is not symmetrical.  Overall, this is an okay photo.  Can''t explain the 2s.  Not very nice voters these days.', '2012-11-08 07:23:03.000000', NULL, 0),
