(6901871, 1038652, 119012, '<td valign="top">i would have scored it a 3 or 4. honestly its nothing special, its a picture of apples. just becuase yo take a picture of apples with a dslr doesn''t mean its going to be great. I do the same thing, my eye says oooh that would make a good picture and when i get home i see it and i wonder why i thought that.<br/> <br/>its needs composition, depth, color all to work together your image does none of this, there is noting to draw me in, nothing to hold my interest. i generally vote by how long an image hold my initial interest on first look with my finger on the 3 button for free studies. i would have probably just hit the three and moved on quickly.<br/> <br/>take a look on at these, look and see what makes each hold your interest or not:<br/> <br/><a href="//500px.com/search?page=5&amp;q=apples&amp;type=photos&amp;utf8=%E2%9C%93" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//500px.com/search?page=5&amp;q=apples&amp;type=photos&amp;utf8=%E2%9C%93</a></td>', 'i would have scored it a 3 or 4. honestly its nothing special, its a picture of apples. just becuase yo take a picture of apples with a dslr doesn''t mean its going to be great. I do the same thing, my eye says oooh that would make a good picture and when i get home i see it and i wonder why i thought that. its needs composition, depth, color all to work together your image does none of this, there is noting to draw me in, nothing to hold my interest. i generally vote by how long an image hold my initial interest on first look with my finger on the 3 button for free studies. i would have probably just hit the three and moved on quickly. take a look on at these, look and see what makes each hold your interest or not: //500px.com/search?page=5&q=apples&type=photos&utf8=%E2%9C%93', '2012-11-08 07:40:45.000000', NULL, 0),
