(6902018, 1038784, 138630, '<td valign="top">Superb!  Must admit I am one who is a little weary of sky shots as you note in one of your score tracking comments.  A little weary of sunrise and sunset landscapes, too.  And of slow shutter seascapes.  And gorgeous drop macros.  And beautifully lit, dramatic studio portraits.  I could go on.  But the truth is I cannot resist any of these when they are truly well done and this certainly is.  Beautiful and worthy.  Congratulations on the red, Dennis.</td>', 'Superb!  Must admit I am one who is a little weary of sky shots as you note in one of your score tracking comments.  A little weary of sunrise and sunset landscapes, too.  And of slow shutter seascapes.  And gorgeous drop macros.  And beautifully lit, dramatic studio portraits.  I could go on.  But the truth is I cannot resist any of these when they are truly well done and this certainly is.  Beautiful and worthy.  Congratulations on the red, Dennis.', '2012-11-08 11:47:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6902021, 1039785, 138630, '<td valign="top">Ah, so beautiful.  Never had the opportunity to see this much less photograph it but I do so enjoy sharing it through photos such as yours.  Congratulations on the ribbon.</td>', 'Ah, so beautiful.  Never had the opportunity to see this much less photograph it but I do so enjoy sharing it through photos such as yours.  Congratulations on the ribbon.', '2012-11-08 11:48:43.000000', NULL, 0),
