(6902034, 1039098, 138630, '<td valign="top">A wonderful capture - beautiful shutter speed.  Like <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=65234" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">MaryO</a> I had mixed feelings about the horizon line.  Upon reflection, I think I agree with her that the tilt increases the sensation of being pulled in to the wave and image.  Congratulations on the top ten.</td>', 'A wonderful capture - beautiful shutter speed.  Like  MaryO I had mixed feelings about the horizon line.  Upon reflection, I think I agree with her that the tilt increases the sensation of being pulled in to the wave and image.  Congratulations on the top ten.', '2012-11-08 12:06:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6902036, 1039300, 138630, '<td valign="top">I thought it looked a bit over-processed, but I could not deny the effective shutter speed and composition.  8 from me and not in my top ten if that makes you feel any better LOL  I do really like it, though, if you don''t mind my saying that.  Congratulations on the top ten overall.</td>', 'I thought it looked a bit over-processed, but I could not deny the effective shutter speed and composition.  8 from me and not in my top ten if that makes you feel any better LOL  I do really like it, though, if you don''t mind my saying that.  Congratulations on the top ten overall.', '2012-11-08 12:09:39.000000', NULL, 0),
