(6902290, 1039039, 113278, '<td valign="top">Brave indeed and a great shot as the result. I have never been assaulted but I have had an ear full.</td>', 'Brave indeed and a great shot as the result. I have never been assaulted but I have had an ear full.', '2012-11-08 16:49:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6902293, 1038676, 112739, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe I didn''t comment on this! I drive past it twice a day and have stopped to photograph it too. Also can''t believe you got "0" comments on this in voting. But, your score and placement is actually pretty good. Free studies are a bit brutal. The colors look spot on to me. Good work at keeping them natural looking.</td>', 'I can''t believe I didn''t comment on this! I drive past it twice a day and have stopped to photograph it too. Also can''t believe you got "0" comments on this in voting. But, your score and placement is actually pretty good. Free studies are a bit brutal. The colors look spot on to me. Good work at keeping them natural looking.', '2012-11-08 16:54:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6902308, 1039858, 19825, '<td valign="top">This is a sweet shot in so many ways.</td>', 'This is a sweet shot in so many ways.', '2012-11-08 17:16:23.000000', NULL, 0),
