(6903095, 1039313, 54446, '<td valign="top">This should have finished higher.  I gave it a 7.  I love the capture of the harvest.  It really could be history photo for your region.  The environmental setting and background are wonderful.  Constrained by 800 pixels probably hurt this image.  I have never seen this kind of cranberry harvest, but this image makes me want to travel to see.</td>', 'This should have finished higher.  I gave it a 7.  I love the capture of the harvest.  It really could be history photo for your region.  The environmental setting and background are wonderful.  Constrained by 800 pixels probably hurt this image.  I have never seen this kind of cranberry harvest, but this image makes me want to travel to see.', '2012-11-09 11:27:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6903121, 1038668, 131871, '<td valign="top">I love that the mast (is that the right term?) almost cuts the scene right were the color turns from blue to that wonderful gold. :)</td>', 'I love that the mast (is that the right term?) almost cuts the scene right were the color turns from blue to that wonderful gold. :)', '2012-11-09 12:03:03.000000', NULL, 0),
