(6903701, 1039039, 100393, '<td valign="top">(Better late than never but) I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Great fast and accurate focus at this DOF. Brilliant contrast in the tones too. A brave capture to get - but it has such life and is very ''of a moment''. I can see she is cross but I wouldn''t have guessed she was cross at you. Well done for running the gauntlet!<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Not really.<br/> <br/>Overall: I''d have thought this was a bvy too. Enough said.</td>', '(Better late than never but) I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Great fast and accurate focus at this DOF. Brilliant contrast in the tones too. A brave capture to get - but it has such life and is very ''of a moment''. I can see she is cross but I wouldn''t have guessed she was cross at you. Well done for running the gauntlet! Critical stuff: Not really. Overall: I''d have thought this was a bvy too. Enough said.', '2012-11-10 12:05:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6903707, 1035904, 100393, '<td valign="top">(Better late than never but) I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Wow, this is extreme - an invitation for the imagination; me, I see two riders on horseback. Great ghostly tones too.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Wow, this is extreme!<br/> <br/>Overall: A challenging image with both sides of the flip.</td>', '(Better late than never but) I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Wow, this is extreme - an invitation for the imagination; me, I see two riders on horseback. Great ghostly tones too. Critical stuff: Wow, this is extreme! Overall: A challenging image with both sides of the flip.', '2012-11-10 12:13:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6903714, 1038961, 100393, '<td valign="top">(Better late than never but) I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Great catch in mores ways than one! Great silhouettes and a great onward view of the Statue of Liberty. You are right it offers a simple (but effective) story.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: The stuff you already know - still wonky horizon and rather flat tones (your image carries it though)<br/> <br/>Overall: I like it!</td>', '(Better late than never but) I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Great catch in mores ways than one! Great silhouettes and a great onward view of the Statue of Liberty. You are right it offers a simple (but effective) story. Critical stuff: The stuff you already know - still wonky horizon and rather flat tones (your image carries it though) Overall: I like it!', '2012-11-10 12:26:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(6903716, 1039890, 100393, '<td valign="top">(Better late than never but) I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Brilliant snapshot with attitude. Great technical capture and a superb family moment. Your contrast handling and vignette work really well. I''m a fan of your coloration too.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nope.<br/> <br/>Overall: More than the sum of it''s parts. Great stuff.</td>', '(Better late than never but) I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Brilliant snapshot with attitude. Great technical capture and a superb family moment. Your contrast handling and vignette work really well. I''m a fan of your coloration too. Critical stuff: Nope. Overall: More than the sum of it''s parts. Great stuff.', '2012-11-10 12:33:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6903719, 1039854, 100393, '<td valign="top">(Better late than never but) I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Great sense of perspective and an interesting subject too. It''s a sad scene too I suppose, but I''m glad you''ve capture. The old swings are at least balanced by an optimistic sky. The tilted horizon works well too.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: There seems to be a bit of halo''ing around the top of the swing cross member.<br/> <br/>Overall: Well made.</td>', '(Better late than never but) I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Great sense of perspective and an interesting subject too. It''s a sad scene too I suppose, but I''m glad you''ve capture. The old swings are at least balanced by an optimistic sky. The tilted horizon works well too. Critical stuff: There seems to be a bit of halo''ing around the top of the swing cross member. Overall: Well made.', '2012-11-10 12:39:04.000000', NULL, 0),
