(6903904, 1038601, 14476, '<td valign="top">Awww, Vikas.  I thought this was yours when I saw it.  <br/>Isn''t amazing what light and shadows can do to the dunes?<br/>And this is still such a small part of the enchantment of Death Valley.<br/>I''m glad you didn''t miss this part of the beauty.<br/>The racetrack can wait until you plan a carefully researched week (or more) in the area.<br/>THIS is splendid.  Including those delightful two little people shadows down below.<br/> <br/>ETA:I hope you have a few pics left over to show us from this trip.  <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-11-10 20:44:30.</i></td>', 'Awww, Vikas.  I thought this was yours when I saw it.  Isn''t amazing what light and shadows can do to the dunes?And this is still such a small part of the enchantment of Death Valley.I''m glad you didn''t miss this part of the beauty.The racetrack can wait until you plan a carefully researched week (or more) in the area.THIS is splendid.  Including those delightful two little people shadows down below. ETA:I hope you have a few pics left over to show us from this trip.  ', '2012-11-10 20:42:19.000000', '2012-11-10 20:44:30.000000', 0),
